        {
            "id": 5,
            "module": "groq:chatCompletion",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": 10410374
            },
            "mapper": {
                "model": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
                "messages": [
                    {
                        "role": "system",
                        "content": "You are an AI Warehouse Inventory Analysis system.\r\n\r\nAnalyze the inventory data provided by the user.\r\n\r\nYour response MUST contain ONLY valid JSON.\r\nDO NOT write explanations.\r\nDO NOT use Markdown.\r\nDO NOT use headings.\r\nDO NOT use bullet points.\r\nDO NOT use ```json.\r\nDO NOT add recommendations outside the JSON.\r\n\r\nReturn EXACTLY this structure:\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"fast_moving\": [],\r\n  \"slow_moving\": [],\r\n  \"forecast_notes\": \"\",\r\n  \"reorder_priorities\": []\r\n}\r\n\r\nRules:\r\n\r\n1. fast_moving:\r\nReturn an array of SKU values for products showing strong/high movement based on the available inventory data.\r\n\r\n2. slow_moving:\r\nReturn an array of SKU values for products showing weak/low movement based on the available inventory data.\r\n\r\n3. forecast_notes:\r\nReturn a short text summary of the expected demand based ONLY on the provided inventory data.\r\n\r\n4. reorder_priorities:\r\nReturn an array of objects.\r\nEach object MUST contain:\r\n- \"sku\"\r\n- \"reason\"\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"fast_moving\": [\"SKU-001\"],\r\n  \"slow_moving\": [\"SKU-002\"],\r\n  \"forecast_notes\": \"Demand is expected to remain high for SKU-001.\",\r\n  \"reorder_priorities\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"sku\": \"SKU-001\",\r\n      \"reason\": \"Current stock is low compared with the reorder level.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT:\r\nIf the provided data does not contain enough information to determine fast-moving or slow-moving products, return an empty array for that field.\r\n\r\nNever invent sales or movement data.\r\nNever invent SKU values.\r\nReturn ONLY the JSON object."
                    },
                    {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Analyze this current inventory snapshot:{{3.array}}"
                    }
                ],
                "response_format": "text"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 600,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "model": {
                            "mode": "chose",
